'''Mr. Maw''' walks towards Isaac and when in range it will launch its head towards him. It appears to be a {{E|Maw}} attached to a {{E|Gusher}} and will turn into either upon death depending on the killed body segment. It can also randomly separate at will into a Gusher and a Maw.

