'''Mr. Red Maw''' behaves similarly to Mr. Maw, but moves quicker and has a {{E|Red Maw}} as its head instead of a regular {{E|Maw}}. If the Red Maw segment is killed first, it will release four shots in the cardinal directions like a regular Red Maw. It can also occasionally separate at will.
