== Trivia ==
* Mr. Mine and Mr. Red Maw were added in [[Booster Pack #5]].
* Though the {{E|Maw}} appears to have eyes when attached to the {{E|Globin}}, if the Maw survives and spawns upon the Swinger's death, then it will have empty eye sockets.
* {{dlc|a+}} Mr. Maw makes Gaper noises while chasing Isaac, while Mr. Red Maw makes the Maw noise only if the {{E|Red Maw}} segment dies first.
* Mr. Mine is based on the enemy Crunch from [[wikipedia:The End Is Nigh (video game)|The End is Nigh]].

